# Local copies of production keys that can't be reissued (docs/reference/secrets.md). Copy to .env.production
# (git-ignored, at the main checkout's root) and fill in. Dev tooling never loads this file. Never commit real values.

# The device certificate key (Ed25519 private key as JWK JSON) of the production cloud: `wrangler secret put
# DEVICE_CERT_KEY` from cloud/ (cloud/README.md). Released hosts compile in its public half.
# CODYNC_DEVICE_CERT_KEY={"kty":"OKP","crv":"Ed25519","d":"…","x":"…"}


# The host update signing seed (base64 Ed25519), the GitHub Actions secret HOST_UPDATE_SIGNING_KEY: its public half
# is packaging/updates/host-public-key.txt, so a new one breaks updates for every installed host.
# CODYNC_HOST_UPDATE_SIGNING_KEY=…
